raffic is a positive sign of international trade and tourism activities, business activities and the attractiveness of India as a tourist destination."},{"question":"What does the International Air Passenger Traffic data represent?","answer":"This data represents the number of passengers carried by airlines between India and international destinations. It includes the total number of passengers who have travelled on international flights to and from India during a specified period."},{"question":"How to interpret the International Air Passenger Traffic data?","answer":"Analysing this data involves looking at long-term trends, understanding seasonal variations such as increased travel during holidays or specific domestic events, and the impact of global events such as international summits or sports events.^Trends in international air traffic can be correlated with other indicators such as Foreign Direct Investment (FDI), international trade figures, and global tourism trends to understand overall economic health and outlook.^Increasing international passenger traffic can signify better global economic ties and a positive outlook for international investments and collaborations. Identifying popular or growing international routes can provide insights into economic and cultural ties with different regions."}],"related":[{"slug":"baltic-dry-index","title":"Baltic Dry Index"},{"slug":"crude-oil-price-indian-basket","title":"Crude Oil Price (Indian Basket)"},{"slug":"external-commercial-borrowings-ecbs","title":"External Commercial Borrowings (ECBs)"},{"slug":"foreign-exchange-reserves","title":"Foreign Exchange Reserves"},{"slug":"foreign-tourist-arrivals","title":"Foreign Tourist Arrivals"},{"slug":"gross-foreign-direct-investment-fdi","title":"Gross Foreign Direct Investment (FDI)"},{"slug":"gross-foreign-portfolio-investment-fpi","title":"Gross Foreign Portfolio Investment (FPI)"},{"slug":"import-cover-months","title":"Import Cover (Months)"},{"slug":"non-oil-exports","title":"Non-Oil Exports"},{"slug":"port-cargo-traffic","title":"Port Cargo Traffic"},{"slug":"services-trade-net-inflows","title":"Services Trade- Net Inflows"}],"title":"Air Passenger Traffic - International","description":"India's international air passenger traffic stands at 6,405.5 Thousand for Aug 2026. This reflects both outbound leisure demand and inbound business and tourism activity.","headline":{"Absolute":"India's international air passenger traffic stands at 6,405.5 Thousand for Aug 2026. This reflects both outbound leisure demand and inbound business and tourism activity.","Y-o-Y":"India's international air passenger traffic stands at -4.01% for Aug 2026. This reflects both outbound leisure demand and inbound business and tourism activity."},"source":"CMIE Economic Outlook, 1 Finance Research","source_url":"https://economicoutlook.cmie.com/","date_modified":"2026-08-01","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:06:19+00:00"}